{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "0ec1d59663330b4c3041e10271591a9459855653ced6c5f22caf56eee800a45b",
  "bundle_request_count": 16,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1692b016a848902be64a9637c316a0cc3fbd2ca2d9b5fa445af6e9228a2cb5df",
      "request_id": "1692b016a848902be64a9637c316a0cc3fbd2ca2d9b5fa445af6e9228a2cb5df",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "76c6cbc9e885715f71888498fdbbb1cb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "高芙四十七胜，辛辛那提夺冠，温网和美网都进了四强。佩古拉五十胜，拿下迪拜和查尔斯顿，两人的赛季表现都够硬。我略偏高芙，主要依据是今年直接交手两胜，加上她的移动防守。但近期也都有疑问：高芙北京十六强后因疲劳退出武汉，佩古拉伤停回归后在武汉首战输给奥斯塔彭科。夏天的好状态，需要在年终重新证明。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bf17e1d893fed64112ec1d9eafc2e4f1242ba35532985ed7fb88b7bbf6b20686",
      "words_sha256": "e7d079214449b3e3656407ca576f648713e400ac98023d5dd1d08dcab07048ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1f50f7b38d1e8e65de99462ca00955272f7931912bbb3129269813b90077093e",
      "request_id": "1f50f7b38d1e8e65de99462ca00955272f7931912bbb3129269813b90077093e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "25cafc1b28110948eb93baab0ed074ea",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "穆霍娃对萨巴伦卡三比二领先，但今年布里斯班是萨巴伦卡赢了，不能只看历史总数。安德烈耶娃对斯维托丽娜一比一，今年澳网赢球的是斯维托丽娜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a4a5b47dd46bb455f2cea5bf045e903c9dda9d4d9f59d06b5243f559359a3c43",
      "words_sha256": "eb94bd424fe5f41efea9ce30eaceea060ec99a8cc362cb8fb5b7a2b0d58d31b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3596a8609e8a549c24a11efc2aa08c515ed474c92c0815967fbf1bc4b1d00af6",
      "request_id": "3596a8609e8a549c24a11efc2aa08c515ed474c92c0815967fbf1bc4b1d00af6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0b3c70b881aaf5a464f50fd86432189b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这次年终分组，最有意思的是谁恰好克谁。先看十二组历史交锋，再看今年状态，最后给出我的四强和冠军选择。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "052a43e89a9856e65fa230ad025387c8f78cef80f619e0684d95fb49ad1625d0",
      "words_sha256": "aa748fbfacdaff4e8b7b9c3df2b2ccc74905895514d3af2d973186a3c9ed42a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:42c8e4f9065f6a61091cee49844fb93a5c23b73b71487c7568f0c7097df2ddc4",
      "request_id": "42c8e4f9065f6a61091cee49844fb93a5c23b73b71487c7568f0c7097df2ddc4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7320330eee300a2204e2f04e97fde321",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她对诺斯科娃也三比零，不过今年没有交手。高芙和佩古拉则是五比五；更有参考价值的是今年两次交手，高芙都赢了，其中一次就是辛辛那提决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "283371a90426da56452023a756ff271b0c37e42b025b924b096abdb5331affb4",
      "words_sha256": "6e551e06e9b1d5b9c3c1c0ed4932dea0412a88886e1adc2ee1a3c0308c0f48a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:49a3fde403a4b2694dfdfa228bcc98281ef3902e1088974c7986a7fe0ed64f72",
      "request_id": "49a3fde403a4b2694dfdfa228bcc98281ef3902e1088974c7986a7fe0ed64f72",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4e8e74e93852907d41edcffcf431f8a4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "安德烈耶娃五十胜、三冠，法网拿到首个大满贯，最近还打进北京决赛。所以我看好她，不只因为成长快，而是今年确实有成绩支撑。但法网是红土；在这组硬帝对抗里，她对斯维托丽娜的最新一场又输了。这个第二名选择，我只给她微弱优势。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e674c72fa74a084e3f3fa3b9869cfa2f0f7125df65fa171f6708ee916e84f057",
      "words_sha256": "a63b66124b9bd24b57fdd5efcee6503dbc937a566bc176a761f34c726f5ed027"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5051c42f92daeefe82ee0dd797cdcbc49623c395aa4029bd32942ec480c40222",
      "request_id": "5051c42f92daeefe82ee0dd797cdcbc49623c395aa4029bd32942ec480c40222",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "21574159244c934d80f2bc6432cca055",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二组，萨巴伦卡对安德烈耶娃四比二，对斯维托丽娜六比一。不过安德烈耶娃赢了最近一次交手，就是去年的印第安维尔斯决赛。今年两人还没有碰过面。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6ed0fbf38f57bd07fe76d74a2f194cfa6096465c92c636facd3061b16209269c",
      "words_sha256": "9a35ccf5fc445b69882cd40612f8628bf760ea1f49567d2c7615870ab5bb281f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6046c0dbcb1b16e0ced645a00c73475f005c7267084ef2d193e84913e53d79f0",
      "request_id": "6046c0dbcb1b16e0ced645a00c73475f005c7267084ef2d193e84913e53d79f0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a080e46424cbce23a125b3294daa1203",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "萨巴伦卡今年四十七胜、三冠，拿到印第安维尔斯和迈阿密的阳光双冠。这里的夺冠经历，是她争冠的重要依据。不过最近武汉首战就输给了安·李，她并非带着连胜来到年终。我的判断是第二组仍先选她，但要看进攻失误能否控制住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7205f40370990cc45287f1b65f2d7b5fa70f32755bd25847192da138ec19cbe1",
      "words_sha256": "faa53f12055c7bf3af794b672942cb5595c541dbdb1eff9abff8f8c451a2db60"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:93addf989e3203278b8c591609f688f98267f26db0e0d265681324fcc78a9de8",
      "request_id": "93addf989e3203278b8c591609f688f98267f26db0e0d265681324fcc78a9de8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "17c175437486addddc406347e750e559",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "诺斯科娃是这组的搅局者。她对高芙一比二，却赢了今年马德里那场；对佩古拉更是三比一领先。但马德里是红土，今年伯林对佩古拉那场是草地，不能直接照搬到硬帝。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ef8ad4156e9cffdd84a230b59dfbf3138f9f038452509677d9e4dee3267c57fa",
      "words_sha256": "5401d5b817cb8a9d2a408156164973400a634e30a3e538e69b5eb8f4c140ce64"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:962aa41bc879cb363ba3ba3f2492c7e89d247b5337d88b3c33231f7a0c987d30",
      "request_id": "962aa41bc879cb363ba3ba3f2492c7e89d247b5337d88b3c33231f7a0c987d30",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fa82df6bc58be2ed9c9fd349dbdfbff1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后两组，安德烈耶娃对穆霍娃一比零，但唯一一场是二零二四年宁波，穆霍娃伤退，参考价值有限。斯维托丽娜对穆霍娃三比一，今年斯图加特那次却是穆霍娃获胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c1bc99e91846efd60ce4071f8ed1be84004e06cfbc1982d964955322bbe6195e",
      "words_sha256": "21ba788f6097c4f40c4592aadd516849ffc8e2f0ded30a52e74d82432cdf0794"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c3601372d6eb1f523ce88766f6630ded1d4e344839c75bbbc0d78625db16580e",
      "request_id": "c3601372d6eb1f523ce88766f6630ded1d4e344839c75bbbc0d78625db16580e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ab65451a8162194e05745e1f1706fe6c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "诺斯科娃今年三十五胜，伯林和温网两冠，三月还在印第安维尔斯进了四强。她有硬帝竞争力，绝不只是草地高手。但十月因左小腿伤退出武汉，这次又是年终首秀。我的判断是：她能改变小组走势，能否稳定出线，还要看身体和发球能否连续三场撑住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "68cb2843ff901f4da768702618bdb7e44a10c21b02170d487aa87ddf3582194b",
      "words_sha256": "6a11c0093ef16fb0d2c26079416dcdd5e2b0382f98c0cd161f4af56acf89843c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c60410d9111f97e459c06a9d34a482619a0284b0fa0dc6187696c5569fc1d887",
      "request_id": "c60410d9111f97e459c06a9d34a482619a0284b0fa0dc6187696c5569fc1d887",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5c62f0a7d9ce2a2969a0cceec3071d9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "综合交锋、今年成绩和近期情况，第一组我选莱巴金娜、高芙，前提是莱巴金娜身体允许。第二组我选萨巴伦卡、安德烈耶娃。最想提醒的是第二组第二名：斯维托丽娜和穆霍娃都有明确的反对理由，这个位置最容易改写预测。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8c1e78a54166c68d49583cf89ed5952a4c535c847d1a7d18e71152d1c73b164d",
      "words_sha256": "6998369c19d6fc7e74102a0986950087393530a0c2a01f4a351b4324e2346319"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d73ff04025a86562b0ee85a88bf13b20c5bad2cba8e84d2b3749f6529c3faa9f",
      "request_id": "d73ff04025a86562b0ee85a88bf13b20c5bad2cba8e84d2b3749f6529c3faa9f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a58ddeb680b4b3efc9a40c74b7b5d3d4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看第一组。莱巴金娜对高芙二比一，对佩古拉六比三。今年对这两人合计五战全胜，所以她的优势有交锋依据，绝不只是世界第一这个排名。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "aa5792c7fe57a7e8070e1afd6e16b900582a1666ca8303ec98b4a3c63c68e839",
      "words_sha256": "f8d92e0bd91769992d48517c6d9233bbf8c120bc71dd6dec2b9070887b3abec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dca207443563b2552e889838961bf2e2fe739a8457b353155bc6b5db819ee0ef",
      "request_id": "dca207443563b2552e889838961bf2e2fe739a8457b353155bc6b5db819ee0ef",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a207dfcfc4de30915816dc8214958b6b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "斯维托丽娜四十八胜、两冠，奥克兰和罗马都拿了冠军；亚洲赛季在北京、武汉连续进八强。她还有二零一八年年终夺冠经验。以近况和今年对安德烈耶娃的胜利来看，她是我最防的第二名竞争者。若安德烈耶娃在常回合里缺少耐心，这个名额完全可能易主。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7c242cc5eef99ef75c98fc35408a6ffa8cd4c40eddb9907144fc22006039cdfa",
      "words_sha256": "b5735e3d83ecdd13245db581343bdf658ccfdbc80fa2403d6a6299368f9b8d5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dd757dbf84c1aa8ff9817d06960ef0c0f770d41fd242f95d162aa2f1633b32ed",
      "request_id": "dd757dbf84c1aa8ff9817d06960ef0c0f770d41fd242f95d162aa2f1633b32ed",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "402547a6585bfb75b4db99372da70b13",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "交锋看完，再看今年状态。莱巴金娜五十四胜、四冠，澳网和美网都夺冠，宁波也刚拿下冠军。这是我看好她的底气。但十月三十日，她因颈部伤情退出东京。接下来最需要确认的是恢复程度，不能把此前的强势直接当作现在完全健康。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "92545d12222bf9c246a6ffbbc450d75607e43fd91a94bb9a5a758e06b11f763b",
      "words_sha256": "6cf6b1dbb2be41e0adff6c8a66f51307c57002aa9b07d9b541e6f815f1a694e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e8e96abae181eb79a367f441e47a1ba07898495ae88e09bd38ef6e4128fcced8",
      "request_id": "e8e96abae181eb79a367f441e47a1ba07898495ae88e09bd38ef6e4128fcced8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fde4be15ced7aa16a3a001dd7c5f19ff",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "穆霍娃四十一胜、两冠，多哈夺冠，温网打进决赛。她的放短和上网，能给三位底线型对手不同的压力。但最近武汉止步十六强，今年对萨巴伦卡也输了。我的判断是她有制造冷门的对位能力，出线却还需要把变化转化成连续两三场的稳定执行。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "037c10545b4f6355ca757d9767a04f58996f594526c9f473de1ddfc34c019d9d",
      "words_sha256": "db03c7a986ad3f3f849b37cad1362203e6a89c110945afdc88e25fa2b935d684"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ece3523b99b010363e1faf9fa476154da128a551318205bd1c74bab0a336a7e6",
      "request_id": "ece3523b99b010363e1faf9fa476154da128a551318205bd1c74bab0a336a7e6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b5b6b2f58b016cd1667432e1616627cb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "冠军我仍倾向莱巴金娜，前提是颈部恢复到能正常发球和连续比赛。她和萨巴伦卡今年四次交手各赢两场，差距很小。如果恢复不理想，我会把萨巴伦卡放到第一顺位。这个预测最大的开关，是健康；最难判断的出线位，是第二组第二名。你会把谁换进四强？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "02adc7e272872390276c0637ab98fc21b9525a38d6b56b27001e40f7c9813670",
      "words_sha256": "f58de1b19c9b2a49b8a04014772ae1be31e778ba4a961f98bfe8ad40d663eb5b"
    },
